      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Krea2 CcC Text-to-Image workflow.\n\nFlow:\n- UNETLoader -> CcC Krea2 - Text to Image -> ModelSamplingAuraFlow -> BlackwellAttentionFix -> KSampler.\n- CLIPLoader feeds the native Krea2 text encoder into Text to Image.\n- Text to Image returns the unchanged MODEL plus positive CONDITIONING, negative CONDITIONING, and an empty SD3-compatible LATENT.\n- KSampler consumes all four outputs.\n- VAEDecode uses qwen_image_vae.safetensors and the result is saved with SaveImage.\n\nCurrent example settings:\n- prompt: cinematic futuristic coastal city at golden hour\n- aspect_ratio: 16:9\n- megapixels: 1.0\n- batch_size: 1\n- custom_aspect_width/height: ignored because aspect_ratio is not custom\n- negative_prompt: empty\n- sampler: 8 steps, CFG 1, Euler, beta, denoise 1.0\n\nThe Text to Image node supports:\n- 1:1, 4:3, 3:4, 16:9, 9:16, 3:2, 2:3, or custom aspect ratio\n- 0.25 to 2.0 MP\n- batch sizes from 1 to 64\n- optional negative_prompt\n- optional prompt_augmentation from CcC Krea2 - LoRA Stack\n\nWhen prompt_augmentation is connected, its prepend/append positive and negative text is applied before CLIP encoding."
      ],
      "title": "Workflow Notes"
    }
